{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0Don't Peek \u2014 a cooperative psychological horror set in a cyberpunk style with a mysterious, gripping storyline. You are a team of explorers and hunters of dark forces, working undercover on black-market contracts across different eras, all through a mysterious portal and dangerous time loops. Your hideout is a secret base disguised as a retro club, where the past and future intertwine in a frantic loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time is a trap. Completing each contract can lead to catastrophe \u2014 and every &quot;peek&quot; might awaken something far more sinister. In this chaos, you must survive, uncover the secret of the portal, and stop the rifts before it's too late. But be careful \u2014 something lurks in the shadows that feeds on your fears and subconscious. Don't peek \u2014 because even a whisper can attract its attention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>The game supports voice and text chat</u></i>, but enemies can react to sound \u2014 to every word, step, and even breath. Speak quietly, think before you speak \u2014 every word can be your downfall. Welcome to a world where nothing can be fully trusted, and your greatest enemy is your own mind. There is also another shadow, beyond any time or rules \u2014 PvP mode, where one of you turns into a maniac due to frequent portal use.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634220/extras/b024a493dbdd50378648f5de6e56f72d.webp?t=1774085072\" width=400 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>The game</strong></i></u> features a large lobby for socializing, playing, and training. While waiting for other players, to avoid boredom, I made it very spacious and plan to regularly add various mini-games and Easter eggs so you can interact and get to know other players if you don't want to play the main story. I also plan to introduce a collectible system where you can find items hidden in secret corners across different maps. In the future, there will be options to customize your lobby and character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634220/extras/b80db015ee4f6a1672b828a82112dca2.poster.avif?t=1774085072\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634220/extras/b80db015ee4f6a1672b828a82112dca2.webm?t=1774085072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634220/extras/b80db015ee4f6a1672b828a82112dca2.mp4?t=1774085072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634220/extras/16735282bdaf73f3313bd2b7b85a004f.webp?t=1774085072\" width=400 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>The game</strong></i></u> hides unpredictable outcomes that activate depending on your sanity level. Be careful\u2014reality can be dangerous and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634220/extras/21c7b87102e43833b4f94e251545e047.poster.avif?t=1774085072\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634220/extras/21c7b87102e43833b4f94e251545e047.webm?t=1774085072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634220/extras/21c7b87102e43833b4f94e251545e047.mp4?t=1774085072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Entrance to Hell","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3634220/5bc9ddb8f3468ec94338f4c3bf92ac3d65b93978.jpg"},{"name":"Not Alone","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3634220/3392d949fb5c04083053d53bf9b395727765074a.jpg"},{"name":"First Steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3634220/90fefbe04c875935411f05aea20e3bfcd615786b.jpg"},{"name":"Lesson Learned","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3634220/a33abca63f62310b762291d9d3f69f9c3739624b.jpg"},{"name":"Admitted","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3634220/a3f685e0e81ae0d10451c7473101d55fda6a5aeb.jpg"},{"name":"Discharged","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3634220/77733d19609703a6c8184893bdb26438db0f2990.jpg"},{"name":"It Found You","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3634220/627b0935fe91265874311652345b61368ea124a8.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3634220?t=1774085072","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634220/a58b326990d8c791c5e389c7ebe7ce9e817595cc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774085072","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634220/08cef37e40f7fe1dfe7169e0a085c2a7ce5b96f9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774085072","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634220/08cef37e40f7fe1dfe7169e0a085c2a7ce5b96f9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774085072","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0Don't Peek \u2014 a cooperative psychological horror set in a cyberpunk style with a mysterious, gripping storyline. You are a team of explorers and hunters of dark forces, working undercover on black-market contracts across different eras, all through a mysterious portal and dangerous time loops. Your hideout is a secret base disguised as a retro club, where the past and future intertwine in a frantic loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time is a trap. Completing each contract can lead to catastrophe \u2014 and every &quot;peek&quot; might awaken something far more sinister. In this chaos, you must survive, uncover the secret of the portal, and stop the rifts before it's too late. But be careful \u2014 something lurks in the shadows that feeds on your fears and subconscious. Don't peek \u2014 because even a whisper can attract its attention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>The game supports voice and text chat</u></i>, but enemies can react to sound \u2014 to every word, step, and even breath. Speak quietly, think before you speak \u2014 every word can be your downfall. Welcome to a world where nothing can be fully trusted, and your greatest enemy is your own mind. There is also another shadow, beyond any time or rules \u2014 PvP mode, where one of you turns into a maniac due to frequent portal use.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634220/extras/b024a493dbdd50378648f5de6e56f72d.webp?t=1774085072\" width=400 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>The game</strong></i></u> features a large lobby for socializing, playing, and training. While waiting for other players, to avoid boredom, I made it very spacious and plan to regularly add various mini-games and Easter eggs so you can interact and get to know other players if you don't want to play the main story. I also plan to introduce a collectible system where you can find items hidden in secret corners across different maps. In the future, there will be options to customize your lobby and character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634220/extras/b80db015ee4f6a1672b828a82112dca2.poster.avif?t=1774085072\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634220/extras/b80db015ee4f6a1672b828a82112dca2.webm?t=1774085072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634220/extras/b80db015ee4f6a1672b828a82112dca2.mp4?t=1774085072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634220/extras/16735282bdaf73f3313bd2b7b85a004f.webp?t=1774085072\" width=400 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>The game</strong></i></u> hides unpredictable outcomes that activate depending on your sanity level. Be careful\u2014reality can be dangerous and unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co